# 🧵 Textile Fiber Explorer

[![Streamlit](https://static.streamlit.io/badges/streamlit_badge_black_white.svg)](https://textile-fiber-explorer.streamlit.app/)
[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.8+-blue.svg)](https://www.python.org/)
[![Streamlit](https://img.shields.io/badge/Streamlit-1.28+-red.svg)](https://streamlit.io/)

An interactive web application for exploring textile fibers from properties to applications and global production.

## 🌟 Features

- **🔍 Fiber Exploration**: Detailed information on various textile fibers
- **📊 Properties Analysis**: Visual representation of fiber properties
- **✅ Advantages/Limitations**: Comprehensive pros and cons analysis
- **👕 Application Insights**: Real-world usage examples
- **🇺🇳 Global Production**: Top producing countries and statistics
- **💡 Did You Know**: Interesting facts about each fiber
- **📈 Interactive Charts**: Dynamic visualizations using Plotly
- **📱 Responsive Design**: Works on desktop and mobile devices

## 🚀 Live Demo

Visit the live application: [Textile Fiber Explorer on Streamlit Cloud](https://textile-fiber-explorer.streamlit.app/)

## 📋 Supported Fibers

The application includes data on:
- **Natural Fibers**: Cotton, Wool, Silk, Linen, Hemp
- **Synthetic Fibers**: Polyester, Nylon, Acrylic, Spandex
- **Specialty Fibers**: Bamboo, Lyocell, Modal

